Cell["Noise Generation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"ecd89611-0758-47b7-95ca-89f937f86e9a"],

Cell["\<\
The built-in \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]noise\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] component  \
generates a pseudo-random set at every execution cycle. The number of \
elements is taken to be the population specified for the outbound path:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f2488400-70d1-4d0a-ab88-b062674ecd1e"],

